{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_title", "source_sha256": "b7d2394ffa3bc550a375d08e58cc933a7e9ede6786bdd7224db8dc0c1f3213d4", "ja": "憧れを乗せて", "zh": "满载憧憬", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5054f60adbf9ba8028cb37cbc448afb708453d57458f13728f5a83169d8a6ffe", "ja": "定期公演で新曲を歌うことになった星梨花。\r\nプロデューサーにどんな曲がいいかと尋ねら\r\nれ悩んでしまうが、劇場の仲間やプロデュー\r\nサーと話すうちに答えにたどりつく。それは\r\nその時感じている気持ちそのものだった。", "zh": "星梨花决定在定期公演上演唱新曲。\n面对制作人关于想要什么样歌曲的询问，\n她陷入了烦恼之中，但在和剧场的同伴以及制作人\n交流的过程中找到了答案。那就是\n将自己彼时所感受到的心意原原本本表达出来的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "621d8eae1ee263980bb5203917415b1e36c627f521ee00c9b66154bef341b5da", "ja": "ジュニオール、いくよ。\nレディー……ゴー！", "zh": "朱尼奥尔，我们上吧。\n准备——开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1001_junior", "source_sha256": "d974ce39350531e742b40df180e31e377531e3c34579914adc3d93867bdf3f15", "ja": "わんっ！　シュバッ！", "zh": "汪！咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "274e60e779293e85abc89ee612e82685e1fd68941477c8474296238da42df3c3", "ja": "わああ！　ジュニオールすごい、綺麗なジャンプ～！\nせりりんの言うこと、全部わかるんだ！？", "zh": "哇啊啊！小儒尼奥尔好厉害，跳得好漂亮～！\n星梨花说的话，全都能听懂啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "99a3ddc8a7218965f6f86aa83aee82511f98b02d5a19aa2b905a343c3b6d1e92", "ja": "星梨花とジュニオールは、通じ合ってるんだよね♪\nえっと～、アメリカンのパンダマンだっけ？", "zh": "星梨花和小俊是心意相通的呢♪\n呃～，是美国的熊猫人来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "ea8128659da81327b8c2b1fb7185363829591da59a0a6d748a360e5eec3e703c", "ja": "アジリティーのハンドラーですね！\n最初はわたし達、うまくできなかったんですけど……。", "zh": "我们是敏捷赛的指导员呢！一开始我们还做得不太好，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "5a5419c213ef497a287035a5b6a0ada214d3dc6d863cb120a4886191d1046842", "ja": "たくさん練習して、できなかったことが\nできるようになって。そのうち仲良しになったんです。", "zh": "经过大量练习，原本做不到的事情也渐渐学会了。后来，我们就成了好朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "3142fd1ef5a13fdd5889f674c70c667a4225cfd92392d998700e143050ca0617", "ja": "あはっ。そういうのってなんか、私たちと同じだね♪\nいっぱい練習してできるようになって、仲良くなって。", "zh": "啊哈。感觉这种经历跟我们挺像的呢♪\n也是通过拼命练习慢慢做到，然后关系越来越好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "ab171dda8a2c43d07c7795e72598ede9d4ae6abf5986e1aa4e352346956a2425", "ja": "あっ、そうかもしれませんね！\nたくさんレッスンして、仲良しになって……。", "zh": "啊，或许真是这样呢！\n一起进行了好多练习，关系也变好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "a96777f64f35db642c03556f4bb87b6cc38439bd1f7c7c87eb0e0dbf5a9bd9ed", "ja": "じゃあ、ジュニオールも私たちの仲間だ！\nこれからもよろしくね、ジュニオール！　わんわん♪", "zh": "那这么说，Junior也是我们的伙伴啦！\n今后也请多多关照哦，Junior！汪汪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1009_junior", "source_sha256": "cdf6337df28204f8998d52e155032539d15179a5acf430e255a63d42fcb8b20e", "ja": "わんわんっ！", "zh": "汪汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "9db0addea253c112f8eadb6f8ffb826c10549f587e24a9ec7f75924dc4652800", "ja": "えへへ、ジュニオール、とっても喜んでます。\nありがとうございます♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，小朱尼奥尔特别开心。\n谢谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "2633555e57d47c3ae8ffdfed3b1fef1eb29fff30ca085df40610a8bcc666c42f", "ja": "じゃあ、いつか一緒に公演に出ようね、ジュニオール！\nこれからは、歌のレッスンも頑張ろー☆", "zh": "那我们以后一起登台演出吧，朱尼奥尔！\n接下来也要努力练习唱歌哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1012_junior", "source_sha256": "23db25b97ae2804c4d9b1f71b728f49678558b8b2d656670d0aef73bf99155c4", "ja": "わん、わ……ん？", "zh": "汪、汪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "4091a7b8ed8bcdefbd3d3bd54a55545cc52de257cf44e7727212283c4909af26", "ja": "あ、そういえば星梨花、新曲のこと考えないと！\nどんな曲がいいか、何か思いついた？", "zh": "啊，对了，星梨花，我们得考虑新歌的事了！\n你有没有想到想要什么样的歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "4e741b932de4170a902d66f54a2333403e6ccf2531429693b93b1320e94a047f", "ja": "うーん……まだ、ぼんやりしてます。\nなんとなく、思ったことはあるんですけど。", "zh": "嗯……还只是有个大概的想法。\n虽然隐约想到了一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "9de3e47923c3128df67de67a0e51485511157d9b83c2ee8ff6c509036113bc22", "ja": "あるんだっ！？　なになに、せりりん？\n教えて教えて♪", "zh": "有的吗！？是什么是什么，星梨花？\n快告诉我嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "8eb6ba4a157f3c2d5610c282c793dbf3406c4382f2051965b31e1f0a068b1ba8", "ja": "……わたし、アイドルになって、毎日とっても楽しい\nんです。びっくりしたり、すごいなって思ったり。", "zh": "……我成为偶像之后，每天都特别开心。\n会遇到很多意想不到的事，也会由衷地感到佩服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "63efe6191fa116505922027adf8edd28937a09c18ab355edbf43cab4f3e64894", "ja": "公演でも、ファンのみなさんがたくさん応援して\nくれます。それがうれしくて、すごくドキドキして。", "zh": "演出时，粉丝们也会为我加油。对此我既开心，又特别激动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "e33250561bab01744e85bf495362448897c53499bd1c5bb8fbd76594a0319e9d", "ja": "でも、わたしもアイドルです。だから、わたしがファン\nのみなさんに、ちゃんとドキドキをあげたいです！", "zh": "可是，我也是偶像。所以，我也想好好带给粉丝们怦然心动的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "d280135ab8a9e799ec7a43a4e7043882157f7b812bef233cdbe2486227e87894", "ja": "ドキドキできる曲かあ。あ、さっき私ドキドキしたよ！\nジュニオールがジャンプしたとき！", "zh": "能让人心跳加速的歌曲啊。啊，我刚才也心跳加速了！\n朱尼奥尔跳起来的时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "5734081320083fce2a2f183a0b71528688d16df146a70686e31ad578b5cf9fc5", "ja": "あ！　じゃあ星梨花がすっごいジャンプするとか？\nすっごく速く走って、海美ちゃんと競争して！", "zh": "啊！那让星梨花来个超级大跳跃怎么样？\n跑得超级快，跟海美比试跑步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "23d10e15da2268850d3686404c335b93d36c7fc7503bcab85dc2deb5c9c3168d", "ja": "いいね、みらいっち！　あとドキドキするのは……\nあ、いっぱい運動したあとは、すごくドキドキするよ！", "zh": "这个主意好，未来！还有让人心跳加速的事情是……\n啊，充分运动之后，心跳就会变得超级快哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "1ec312af3813b1b47cea6de075488eaea306f4207b19ace8435a9dd27a59e8c1", "ja": "私は、生クリームいっぱいのケーキ見てもドキドキ\nするな～。えへへ、美味しいよね、生クリーム～♪", "zh": "看到挤满鲜奶油的蛋糕，我也会心跳加速呢～。诶嘿嘿，鲜奶油很好吃对吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "640da2fc180f2bddbb3c1d47921a2f31924deb467fe35c31303432b9928b9f42", "ja": "えっと、えっと……わたしがすごく走って、たくさん\n飛んで、海美さんと競争して、ケーキを作って……。", "zh": "嗯，嗯……我拼命奔跑，跳了好多次，和海美小姐比赛，还做了蛋糕……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "517f69154938f4647938c0bed9a4fb32a6bf579d3680618b905c94b09c79210b", "ja": "…………ピーーーーーーーーッ。", "zh": "…………哔————。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "22aed6bb84a9cba6ec7fa4caefb55c2a1988be2a57a062e08cc7d9618316eeb8", "ja": "ああっ、星梨花がフリーズしちゃった！\n星梨花～！？", "zh": "啊，星梨花死机了！\n星梨花——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "18add3f758da5c671ea02ba5e07241b5ad0d387bba1d554fdd226a99084c4d4e", "ja": "わっ、ごめんせりりん！\n話してたら、どんどんややこしくなっちゃった！", "zh": "啊，对不起，星梨花！聊着聊着，反而越来越复杂了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "b7ae8e237887d7f09dbe90be5893dbb4002ca38ba96610bb33f8812c36c60660", "ja": "はっ！　い、いえ、大丈夫です！\nごめんなさい、ちょっとこんがらがっちゃいました。", "zh": "啊！不、不，没关系的！\n对不起，我有点糊涂了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1028_junior", "source_sha256": "3853e183812891c9476671e42f4ef9d1f9abf72ffa6f5ade0c9ab4916f010421", "ja": "クゥーン……？", "zh": "呜呜……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "ffdf43f25433820df51f84d93fe4ceb21b83e42fac835eba439ee3e6156d13c8", "ja": "えへへ、ジュニオール、大丈夫だよ。\n……でも、そっか。ジュニオールもだね。", "zh": "嘿嘿，朱尼奥尔，没事的哦。\n……不过，这么说来，朱尼奥尔也是呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "f6d86c14337ba12dc52290b839d724f25d806766856ef20fc7c66c926e17d954", "ja": "なぐさめてくれたり、びっくりさせてくれたり。\nジュニオールからも、もらってばっかり……。", "zh": "有时安慰我，有时又吓我一跳。\n我总是从朱尼奥尔那里得到好多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "5de4214b5fbc71ece5b93864974f3835e6fc0ca15c2651efd699d2311f27cfda", "ja": "わたし、ちゃんとお返しできるかな。\nわたしにも……、何かできるのかな。", "zh": "我能好好回报它吗？\n我也……能做些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "d3111d6b29f31ff2c8151cd75aae207b4dc7e288e79d3ad8c33fb858432bbf6f", "ja": "せりりん？　……どうしたの？", "zh": "星梨花？……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "ba1bfc88fbd1fbbda54ef7bc29eeda245a04b0310ba510dfec5943ab41041a21", "ja": "あ、いいこと思いついちゃった！\n星梨花、劇場に戻ろっ？", "zh": "啊，我想到一个好主意！\n星梨花，我们回剧场吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "1343a372f45b1e92fcc10a4232915c34bd0b58887eeeb999f307eb2cc042a5fd", "ja": "えっ？　劇場にですか？", "zh": "诶？要回剧场吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "a8c62355367380a749fb159da5489e917b8c9760318542f11156aac2d410bf42", "ja": "うんっ、それで聞いてみればいいと思うんだ。\n劇場には、みんながいるんだもん！　ね、いこいこっ♪", "zh": "嗯！我觉得去剧场问问就好了。\n剧场里有大家在嘛！走吧走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1037_p", "source_sha256": "491a42ebbcdf200aa4d03b46fa62639295e872656082655a21a615956a4360ce", "ja": "（ん？　星梨花たち、思ったより早く戻ってきた\nみたいだな。一人増えてるみたいだけど、あれは……）", "zh": "（嗯？星梨花她们好像比想象中回来得还早啊。好像还多了一个人，那是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "ed8cde02dd80d5b99468a4e54ea56299e099b2465b2c5804de6b295bdcacdaf7", "ja": "ニャるほど！　それでたまたま通りかかった茜ちゃんに\n相談とは……さすが星梨花ちゃん、タイミングいいね♪", "zh": "喵懂了！所以就向碰巧路过的小茜请教啊……不愧是星梨花，时机真好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1039_022ser", "source_sha256": "5d59d75cc45d5644f3a12fa83afdfe7611acf1f3136b4d9006b055c2417a7e85", "ja": "はいっ、よろしくお願いします、茜さん！", "zh": "好的！请多多指教，茜姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "374fc89363372de48944259bf40195d5ad2779195dbca9de3adfa237f6a50150", "ja": "任せて任せて♪　で、新曲の方向性だっけ？\nドキドキできる曲……うんうん、悩むよね～それは！", "zh": "交给我交给我♪　所以，是要讨论新歌的方向对吧？\n能让人心跳不已的歌曲……嗯嗯，确实很让人伤脑筋呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1041_023aka", "source_sha256": "2ca5e6474894e54043d357f2aaf02fbee7dc5f2e820531d1ed17afd2bc51de59", "ja": "新曲の方向性とは、つまりアイドルの方向性。\n要するに、まずアイドルとは何かを知るべーし！", "zh": "所谓新歌的方向性，也就是偶像的方向性。\n总之，首先得了解偶像是什么才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "650bcc4a10d55642a594b6b51036ed5b7d098af5c6f97f3aeb22d137fec36cd7", "ja": "茜っち、すごいすごい！　なんかそれっぽい！\nそれでそれで？", "zh": "茜茜，好厉害好厉害！感觉还挺像那么回事的！\n然后然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1043_023aka", "source_sha256": "df92e0c194c2e61a8f1fccc02734f9763c983da0daa14c223b8183d033728561", "ja": "そう、アイドルとは……ずばり、ビジネスなのだー！！\nてことで企業コラボ曲とかどうかな？　どうなのかな？", "zh": "没错，偶像就是……说白了，是门生意——！！\n所以，来首企业合作曲怎么样？到底行不行呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1044_023aka", "source_sha256": "10ad5a14511a842789b8a40ef92d897d85164e90ad102227d93f09c711293e10", "ja": "大量CM投下で大ヒット！　アンド・スポンサー収入！\n巨大ビジネスに発展すれば、もうドッキドキだよ☆", "zh": "大量投放广告引起巨大轰动！外加赞助商收入！\n要是能发展成大生意，那就超级令人心潮澎湃啦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1048_p", "source_sha256": "23b383ef01b652ac64794e8e6fb80e7ad0f96d6a8bfe322b51b260489f8ef004", "ja": "待て待て！　そんな真剣に聞かなくていいぞ。\n茜、あんまり変なこと教えないように！", "zh": "等等！不用听得那么认真啦。\n茜，别教人家奇奇怪怪的东西啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1049_023aka", "source_sha256": "87f787b727a9f61c55ab1481da4787968d425d936e876f89277dea7484bc8bd6", "ja": "あ、{$P$}ちゃんいたの？　でも、\n茜ちゃんは間違ったコト言ってるつもりはないよ！？", "zh": "啊，原来{$P$}在啊？不过，小茜可没打算说什么错话哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1050_p", "source_sha256": "0daad977de6a31061b9451090495b65eae4e95495c33033276b33a212a291c78", "ja": "確かにビジネスでもあるけど、そういうのは\nプロデューサーが考えることだ。", "zh": "确实这也是一门生意，但那些事\n是制作人该考虑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1051_p", "source_sha256": "4f1fa5b39b797bc26b81cd236a1e5adb2e29fea62fe3afb2ff68eecfd4cddd38", "ja": "みんなには、もっと夢をみてもらわないと……。\nでないとアイドルは輝かない！　そうだろう！", "zh": "大家必须做更多的梦才行……。\n否则偶像是不会闪耀的！你说对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1052_023aka", "source_sha256": "a9463ce005ef7ca040abf01618dbc437abe655628c4e9f62c9bf2aa07753fcdc", "ja": "はうっ！　やるね{$P$}ちゃん……。\n頼られて舞い上がった茜ちゃんに正論をぶつけるとは！", "zh": "哈呜！真有你的，{$P$}……  \n居然对因受到依赖而得意忘形的小茜说出这种正论！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1053_005yay", "source_sha256": "43d3e3aafa0937b38ca5a75754a71142df05e41ce7055ce3ddc4fb620f070dcb", "ja": "おはようございまーすっ！\nみんな、なんだか楽しそうですね、えへへっ。", "zh": "早上好——！\n大家看起来好像都很开心呢，嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1054_029umi", "source_sha256": "4303e601edfe0307d69915560727c71483979623ea8a12cdcc6ba71abcf314fe", "ja": "あっ、やよちゃんだ、おはよ☆\nそうだ、やよちゃんにも聞いてみようよ！", "zh": "啊，是弥生！早上好☆\n对了，也问问弥生吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1055_014mir", "source_sha256": "15970ecd81d9db07bae3ef365bdd8b8aea2752af0d44bc4a6cefc0389be52aa6", "ja": "そうだね！　ねえねえ、やよいちゃん。\nやよいちゃんって、どんなときにドキドキする？", "zh": "对呀！那个，弥生。\n弥生你在什么时候会心里怦怦跳？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1056_005yay", "source_sha256": "528c69ce205a5944672cbbf9008fd0df7445e1e086eecd839f581bdc85ea542d", "ja": "え？　ドキドキって……どういうコト？\n急に聞かれて、今ちょっとドキドキしてるけど……？", "zh": "诶？“心跳加速”……是什么意思？\n突然被这么问，我现在就有点心跳加速了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1057_022ser", "source_sha256": "b15288e772c626efc7d8b6716f17782164c127cb3bf0f0eb66e01b1726918988", "ja": "わたしの新曲の話なんです。\nドキドキできる曲がいいって、話してて。", "zh": "是在聊我的新歌。\n我们正在讨论，想要一首能让人心跳加速的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1058_005yay", "source_sha256": "e97e66a424a29075bfecbe9f8f7443611de57606cf60f634edc56ea2242d644d", "ja": "わぁ、それでドキドキなんだね！\nおめでとう、星梨花ちゃん！　それなら、うーん……。", "zh": "哇，原来是因为这个才会心跳加速呀！\n恭喜你，星梨花！　这样的话，嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1059_005yay", "source_sha256": "ba2d39a6155be17091e789d1c33f41e810b2828a147c9d7b1d4c46eed8093da3", "ja": "あっ！　お給料日とかドキドキかも！", "zh": "啊！发薪水的那天说不定会让人小鹿乱撞呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1061_023aka", "source_sha256": "58f5a65e52ea73bc90ab071dc5a53260d2897a1b533bf6229cf203780818223c", "ja": "さすが！　やよいちゃんはわかってるよね、ね！\nアイドルがビジネスなのは、もう宇宙の真理だよねっ♪", "zh": "不愧是你！小弥生果然明白嘛，对吧，对吧！  \n偶像就是一门生意，这已经是宇宙的真理了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1062_005yay", "source_sha256": "c6f8bbfd9d5225458a3fc3d1387df0282de7e1eb3e649b0f4153972e1f409870", "ja": "お給料日は妹や弟達と、ちょっとおいしいもの\n食べようって決めてるの。だから、ドキドキして！", "zh": "发工资那天，我决定和妹妹弟弟们一起吃点好吃的。\n所以，我好期待呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1063_023aka", "source_sha256": "9792dffd946cf039608a30f93c9f2ca2e7c84c4d0870cfd1a63f26b1ba6a0bee", "ja": "……あれっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1064_p", "source_sha256": "06f2c7da8f11c438214cf2e7f22762aab76891780a36c81d9f44e551f1f1c549", "ja": "ふう……。\nさすがやよい、いい話だな。", "zh": "呼……。\n不愧是弥生，说得真好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1065_022ser", "source_sha256": "2a09f66c12351af203f2a641cc1f17782972164e0f1aac420e043a997b8a02b0", "ja": "家族のためなんですね。素敵です！\nそれなのに、わたしは……。", "zh": "是为了家人呢。真棒！\n可我却……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1066_014mir", "source_sha256": "e831dfc49caa0780bcfc467351d7c33379ba9013c47526aa33ad2c25e26fd7f7", "ja": "？　星梨花？", "zh": "？ 星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1067_022ser", "source_sha256": "e2fcd9765b1bcb0b26f1aebf67efef012b747183c9fa7ff86af07b97ab3a6693", "ja": "わたしはいつも、わたしが楽しいばっかりで。だから\nお返ししたいのに、どうしていいかわからなくて……。", "zh": "我一直以来，都光顾着自己开心了。所以\n明明想回报大家，却不知道该怎么做才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1068_022ser", "source_sha256": "cf4c2bc82f00fec06126141c1967ab1e9b49f496f435430c0b1a2c23c2b6c2a9", "ja": "みなさんみたいに、ちゃんとした考えとかもなくて。\nえへへ、ダメですね、わたし。……ごめんなさい。", "zh": "我也没办法像大家那样有深思熟虑的想法。\n诶嘿嘿，我真是不行呢。……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1069_029umi", "source_sha256": "eab3bb398b8e36d17258c08b979245cb11c8be6e3f718cc2f5486432e73147eb", "ja": "せりりん……。", "zh": "星梨梨……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1070_p", "source_sha256": "ca3a9b2a6f3ed641d69387e5fef6a7e4e995afb70342f45d61cc0d832b2c2b9d", "ja": "……そうか。うん、しっかり考えてくれたんだな。\nえらいぞ、星梨花！", "zh": "……这样啊。嗯，你认真思考过了呢。\n真了不起，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1071_022ser", "source_sha256": "14fd50084efd02c3caf29827bc17285fd61980453ff7f248d99522ddf4f57788", "ja": "えっ？　そんな、えらくないですっ。\nまだ何も、ぜんぜんわからないのに……。", "zh": "诶？才没有，没什么了不起的。\n明明我还什么都、完全都不明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1072_p", "source_sha256": "6c602b7fc1c86f958fa5e536787bc78866b4ca0e87c9c8d1ee7f8b0aa0003c09", "ja": "もうわかってるじゃないか。お返ししたいって。\nそれ以上は、無理に見つけなくてもいいんだ。", "zh": "你不是已经明白了吗？想要回报这份心意。除此之外，不用勉强自己去寻找了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1073_p", "source_sha256": "f33012b007aee2b92609cf66216b74b408c33844ffedbce61fbc35f36e91fa5f", "ja": "そういうのはきっと、見つけるんじゃなくて。\n……見つかるものだから。", "zh": "这种东西一定不是靠寻找才能找到的。\n……而是会自己找到你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1074_022ser", "source_sha256": "5e1e39fd4d3a770cef461f0ca4124bca013c41cb2f58820ad538f53950b27cb2", "ja": "……。\n見つかる、もの……。", "zh": "……。\n能被找到的……东西……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1075_p", "source_sha256": "ba03f5ab7aceb086b4e570e0b51105561f5067845e3b339345191da71deda6b8", "ja": "これから一緒に、ゆっくり探していこう！\n星梨花がみんなに、届けたいものを。", "zh": "接下来一起慢慢寻找吧！\n寻找星梨花想要传达给大家的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1076_005yay", "source_sha256": "054965f843325172e4d3aec619cda467b91b1469b9f03918c4d82623675a404b", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん。私もお仕事のことで、たまに\nぐるぐるーって悩んじゃうこともあるけど……。", "zh": "星梨花。我有时也会因为工作的事，烦恼得团团转……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1077_005yay", "source_sha256": "85705cea0c7c8dca842ab588df3f6dbbd8794448a3239a6f314282cf1e76c40e", "ja": "忘れたころにパパパーって答えが見つかったりするから\n大丈夫かなーって！", "zh": "等快忘了的时候，往往啪的一下就能找到答案，\n所以我觉得没事的啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1078_023aka", "source_sha256": "0f3a2b4d0eda0d4a7144a0c7691ce68de933ac590278209ca5a523590d1ea05b", "ja": "そう、茜ちゃんもそんな感じのこと言いたかったの。\n大事なモノは、どこに眠ってるかわからないって♪", "zh": "对，小茜也是想表达类似的意思。重要的东西，说不定就藏在某个不知道的地方♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1079_p", "source_sha256": "d2f87d390f1a2862c0756110b2990b41566af696ac4808929ed16bb072de051f", "ja": "（……そうだったのか？）", "zh": "（……是这样吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1080_029umi", "source_sha256": "421859e48e23071bb6b9428689354af31c219a4a4d7eb22b074877d02edf34bb", "ja": "えっと……あ、困ったら、思いっきり走るといいかも！\nスッキリして、いいこと思いついたりするよ☆", "zh": "那个……啊，要是遇到烦恼的话，尽情跑一跑或许不错！\n心情舒畅了，说不定就能想到什么好主意哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1081_022ser", "source_sha256": "0f7133d10f15a80b4ea4f31fba39e67184dedceea82e91308ffcfeb77e27c4bc", "ja": "やよいさん、茜さん……海美さん……。", "zh": "弥生小姐、茜小姐……海美小姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1082_014mir", "source_sha256": "5e011c01cd73a31dd3c2d7ece1a195b94ea8ae714f7f5f6d58b5fea5dcc30683", "ja": "あ！　私、星梨花と一緒にアイドルしてるときも、\nすっごく楽しくて、ドキドキしてるかも……。", "zh": "啊！我和星梨花一起当偶像的时候，\n也觉得超级开心、好让人心跳加速呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1083_014mir", "source_sha256": "eb2f425ad3072a1d172b9841c033f5b141c2726d1e76e57c92121ac6ba9ad42c", "ja": "てことは、ホントにゆっくり探して大丈夫だねっ。\nだって星梨花、もうみんなをドキドキさせてるもん♪", "zh": "这么说来，真的慢慢找也没关系了呢。\n因为星梨花已经让大家心动不已了嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1084_022ser", "source_sha256": "aaaa6c085eec1f1a32768395d488d6aaa5022adc0a51ed3d4073bfbeb2a75a3e", "ja": "未来さん……。はいっ。\nありがとうございますっ！", "zh": "未来小姐……嗯！谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1085_022ser", "source_sha256": "3a57c197cfb0f5653f4f1aaf823f55c6301686a274ea6dd03f22a554ed4d86e6", "ja": "わたし、これからちゃんと探してみようと思います。\nわたしの……アイドルのわたしが、届けたいもの……。", "zh": "我想接下来自己去好好探寻一番。\n身为你我的……作为偶像的我自己，想要传递给大家的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1086_022ser", "source_sha256": "efa7fb7d9e8ed7a61781e57886dade00555bf439041a769596eb0894fe7a69ab", "ja": "あっ。{$P$}さん！\n見つけました！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n找到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1087_p", "source_sha256": "6b5606f9c1d3bd70ca43289e1aa74c45b17a92b11b798f7ed68477e1ac6cfa60", "ja": "えっ！　も、もう見つけたのか！？", "zh": "诶！这、这么快就找到了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1088_022ser", "source_sha256": "9c700be74e5f3ed1770eba2af0b4b1072a710d6af9dde44c2f20ee5c4b56f123", "ja": "あっ、届けたいものはまだです。\nでも、歌いたい曲を見つけました。", "zh": "啊，想要传达的东西还没找到。\n不过，我找到想唱的歌了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1089_022ser", "source_sha256": "0b49603d6e7e736068feed4748b4c493973809716d9a8ccaaf66cbc828d96e42", "ja": "わたしがみなさんに届けたいって思う、\nステキなもの……。とっても見つけにいきたいです。", "zh": "我想去传达给大家的、\n美好的事物……我真的好想去找寻它们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1090_022ser", "source_sha256": "2bfdaf4f5a22176ebc18baa7b16f41910eaa1547e73de58b5ab5063ccdea692f", "ja": "いろいろな所に、みなさんと一緒にいきたいです。\nそんな、いまの気持ちを歌える曲がいいですっ。", "zh": "我想和大家一起去各种各样的地方。\n如果能有一首唱出我现在这种心情的歌就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1091_022ser", "source_sha256": "0b8412f54c2cb3fcfa7ede3c57aea4a66ab586ca54d56cb2529fb965efaad140", "ja": "だって……。\nいまとっても、明日が楽しみだから！", "zh": "因为……  \n我现在真的特别期待明天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1092_029umi", "source_sha256": "0dc15f8f20e53c828d432f55be004c1e8684d1cf418825cb889970274b5a2dc2", "ja": "わあ……！　いいね、せりりん！　なんかキラキラ\nしそう～！　ね、いいよね、{$P$}！", "zh": "哇……！真好呢，小星梨花！感觉会闪闪\n发光耶～！呐，很棒对吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1093_p", "source_sha256": "02e3ba4e3ff77e171eae3832f5c33ef47dc2a0e49591d174f4fd98ab0b481b2a", "ja": "もちろん、バッチリじゃないかな。\nよし、そんな曲を作ってもらおう！", "zh": "当然，感觉非常合适呢。\n好，那就拜托他们写一首这样的曲子吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1094_014mir", "source_sha256": "81b2058f309a6be79f20d38436f00ca59e551c75507f0fb6250332e4945bdb79", "ja": "わぁっ、よかったね星梨花！\n曲ができたら、たくさんレッスンしようね！", "zh": "哇，太好了呢星梨花！\n等曲子做好了，我们一定要多多练习哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1095_005yay", "source_sha256": "883c33227bbcdbe981c4c4e8c3aff3bfc9a7540698656cc213d74db75c819ca1", "ja": "じゃあ、レッスンもみんな一緒がいいかも！\nみんなで、星梨花ちゃんの公演に進んで行きましょー！", "zh": "那么，练习也大家一起参加比较好吧！大家一起向星梨花的演出进发吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1096_023aka", "source_sha256": "d683a1912c9bca7ab227453fced221b7580467ca44546c474e7f261c6e067bcc", "ja": "フッ。茜ちゃんのアドバイスが、新たな名曲を生んで\nしまいそうだね。……完パケしたらホメていいからね？", "zh": "哼，小茜的建议，说不定会催生出新的名曲呢。……等全部完成后，可要好好夸夸我哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_069_1097_p", "source_sha256": "63ba0aaea557437a1ab609db565e0664aa3eecf0445f4a7ebd2194891e9cd943", "ja": "（星梨花の顔に、もう陰りは見られない。\n新曲公演は、こんな笑顔が客席に溢れるといいな！）", "zh": "（星梨花的脸上已经看不到一丝阴霾了。希望新歌公演时，观众席上也能洋溢着这样的笑容！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
